questions.question_es:
Un clúster reparte claves con 'hash(clave) mod N' y pasa de 4 nodos a 5. ¿Qué imprime este código, es decir, cuántas de las 1000 claves cambian de nodo?

claves = range(1000)
antes = {k: k % 4 for k in claves}
despues = {k: k % 5 for k in claves}
movidas = sum(1 for k in claves if antes[k] != despues[k])
print(movidas)

questions.question_en:
A cluster distributes keys with 'hash(key) mod N' and grows from 4 nodes to 5. What does this code print, i.e. how many of the 1000 keys move to a different node?

keys = range(1000)
before = {k: k % 4 for k in keys}
after = {k: k % 5 for k in keys}
moved = sum(1 for k in keys if before[k] != after[k])
print(moved)
